OL,3,GNEWSAMan who rammed police car with BMW
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who rammed a police car after
OL,7,Fbeing pulled over by officers has been
OL,8,Fjailed for dangerous driving.
OL,10,FKaram Tofeek, 24, was stopped in
OL,11,FHuddersfield after on suspicion of
OL,12,Fdriving without insurance on 23 July.
OL,14,FBut he refused to turn off the car's
OL,15,Fengine and proceeded to ram into the
OL,16,Fpolice car parked in front of him,
OL,17,Fwhile two officers were still inside,
OL,18,Fcausing #6,000 of damage.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
