OL,3,GNEWSAMan who rammed police car with BMW
OL,4,Ajailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, Tofeek, of Leaventhorpe
OL,7,FLane, Bradford, was jailed at Leeds
OL,8,FCrown Court for one year and nine
OL,9,Fmonths, disqualified from driving for
OL,10,Fthree years and seven months and given
OL,11,Fa #187 fine.
